[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13201.269, "timestamp": "03:40:01", "text": "Yosha，但这或许是帮个忙。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13208.63, "timestamp": "03:40:08", "text": "我懂了。这是假的。我想知道。我想知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13210.79, "timestamp": "03:40:10", "text": "他在耍我们。他绝对是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13214.389, "timestamp": "03:40:14", "text": "他真是个混蛋，他绝对是渡渡鸟。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13216.07, "timestamp": "03:40:16", "text": "没错，他绝对是只渡渡鸟。这"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13234.389, "timestamp": "03:40:34", "text": "跳起来，留在我身边。你能留下来陪我吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13237.19, "timestamp": "03:40:37", "text": "当然。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13239.269, "timestamp": "03:40:39", "text": "我好害怕。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13242.79, "timestamp": "03:40:42", "text": "好的，我们跟我来。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13244.309, "timestamp": "03:40:44", "text": "等等，我该怎么做？我忘了该怎么做。好吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13245.91, "timestamp": "03:40:45", "text": "那是制表符。过来。过来。来"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13247.03, "timestamp": "03:40:47", "text": "这里。"}]